sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as  Parent
    participant S as System
    actor Sp as  Specialist

    P->>S: Create child profile
    P->>S: Search specialist by specialisation
    S-->>P: List of verified specialists
    P->>S: Send request + share child profile
    S->>Sp: New request with child's data
    alt Specialist accepts
        Sp->>S: Accept
        S-->>P: Request accepted
        Sp->>S: Create plan and schedule sessions
        S-->>P: Plan and calendar visible
        Sp->>S: Mark session held + comment
        S-->>P: History and recommendations
    else Specialist rejects
        Sp->>S: Reject
        S-->>P: Request rejected, no access given
    end
    P->>S: Revoke access (any time)
    S-->>Sp: Child no longer visible
